#  Non-alien walls (hacker-mode, kageryu, demon, sierengowski, void-vortex,
#  prism brand, etc.) are REMOVED from the ISO — alien theme only.
#  One slug per line; resolves in ~/.config/hypr/walls[/rotation]
#  or /usr/share/backgrounds/nyxus. Comment a line to drop it.
# ============================================================

